,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=The+Shining+Stephen+King',NULL),(79,'Misery',11,7,NULL,1987,'English','Psychological horror about an obsessed fan.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780670813643-M.jpg','9780670813643',320,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Misery+Stephen+King',NULL),(80,'Pet Sematary',11,7,NULL,1983,'English','Horror novel about a burial ground.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780385182447-M.jpg','9780385182447',374,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Pet+Sematary+Stephen+King',NULL),(81,'Verity',29,7,NULL,2018,'English','Dark romantic thriller.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9781791392796-M.jpg','9781791392796',336,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Verity+Colleen+Hoover','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/1aIAe5e2vwG2zb4iLu4oZ9'),(82,'Ugly Love',29,7,NULL,2014,'English','A story about \"friends with benefits\".','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9781476753188-M.jpg','9781476753188',336,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Ugly+Love+Colleen+Hoover',NULL),(83,'Reminders of Him',29,7,NULL,2022,'English','Second chance romance.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9781542025607-M.jpg','9781542025607',335,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Reminders+of+Him+Colleen+Hoover',NULL),(84,'Daisy Jones & The Six',41,7,NULL,2019,'English','Rise and fall of a rock band.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9781524798628-M.jpg','9781524798628',355,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Daisy+Jones+and+The+Six+Taylor+Jenkins+Reid',NULL),(85,'Malibu Rising',41,7,NULL,2021,'English','Drama set in Malibu in 1983.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9781524798659-M.jpg','9781524798659',369,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Malibu+Rising+Taylor+Jenkins+Reid',NULL),(86,'Kafka on the Shore',37,7,NULL,2002,'English','Metaphysical novel by Murakami.','https://books.google.com/books/content?id=AfY51Um5FvcC&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1&source=gbs_api','9781400043662',467,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Kafka+on+the+Shore+Haruki+Murakami',NULL),(87,'Homo Deus',4,7,NULL,2015,'English','A Brief History of Tomorrow.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9781910701874-M.jpg','9781910701874',464,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Homo+Deus+Yuval+Noah+Harari',NULL),(88,'21 Lessons for the 21st Century',4,7,NULL,2018,'English','Analysis of present day challenges.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780525512172-M.jpg','9780525512172',372,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=21+Lessons+for+the+21st+Century+Yuval+Noah+Harari',NULL),(89,'Twisted Games',28,3,2,2021,'English','Rhys Larsen is a strict, emotionally detached bodyguard—until Princess Bridget shatters his rules. She’s stubborn, fiery, and forbidden, but he wants her anyway. Bridget, bound by duty and facing a political marriage she doesn’t want, falls for the one man she can’t have: her protector. Their dangerous, forbidden attraction threatens the throne and their futures. A slow-to-medium burn royal bodyguard romance that can be read as a standalone, with a possessive alpha hero, explicit content, and strong language.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1661221939i/62056013.jpg','9781735056661',456,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Twisted+Games+Ana+Huang','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/0wmqF7rehXCtEo64rlKN8p'),(90,'Twisted Hate',28,3,3,2022,'English','Josh Chen, a charming soon-to-be doctor, hates Jules Ambrose almost as much as he wants her. She’s the one woman immune to his charm, yet the one he can’t stop thinking about. After one explosive night, they agree to an enemies-with-benefits deal—no jealousy, no strings, no falling in love. Jules, a determined ex–party girl studying for the bar exam, wants nothing to do with the infuriating doctor…until she starts seeing the vulnerable side beneath his arrogance. He’s her best friend’s brother, her longtime nemesis, and the only person she shouldn’t want. As past demons resurface, their fiery connection threatens to save them—or break them. A steamy enemies-to-lovers romance that can be read as a standalone, with explicit content and mature themes.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/15088612-L.jpg','9786073908634',514,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Twisted+Hate+Ana+Huang','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/2MiziS8T2QsiPEHwGQnZJz'),(91,'Twisted Lies',28,3,4,2022,'English','Christian Harper is a charming, ruthless man who hides his darkness behind tailored suits, and he’ll do anything to have the one woman he can’t stop wanting—Stella Alonso. She’s sweet, introverted, famous online, and the only person who stirs something real in him. When danger from her past forces her into his world, he breaks his rules and offers a deal she can’t refuse. What starts as fake dating becomes obsession, desire, and a bond built on secrets and lies. As truths surface, their twisted, addictive love risks falling apart. A steamy slow-to-medium burn romance that can be read as a standalone, with a morally gray hero, explicit content, violence, and sensitive themes.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/15144107-L.jpg','9781728274898',578,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Twisted+Lies+Ana+Huang','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/263USF2de29goxIZpY2TsP'),(92,'Slammed',29,18,1,2012,'English','Layken and Will fall for each other, only to discover a secret that forces them apart, pushing them to face grief, responsibility, and forbidden love.','https://ia600100.us.archive.org/view_archive.php?archive=/5/items/l_covers_0012/l_covers_0012_66.zip&file=0012661471-L.jpg','9781468161663',317,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Slammed+Colleen+Hoover',NULL),(93,'Point of Retreat',29,18,2,2012,'English','Layken and Will struggle to hold onto their relationship as new challenges, misunderstandings, and family struggles test their commitment.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/7614159-L.jpg','9781476715926',288,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Point+of+Retreat+Colleen+Hoover',NULL),(94,'This Girl',29,18,3,2013,'English','Will retells their love story from his perspective, revealing hidden moments, deeper feelings, and the truth behind everything they faced.','https://ia800505.us.archive.org/view_archive.php?archive=/35/items/l_covers_0014/l_covers_0014_32.zip&file=0014328438-L.jpg','9781476746531',304,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=This+Girl+Colleen+Hoover',NULL),(95,'Hopeless',29,19,NULL,2012,'English','Sky’s world unravels when she meets Holder, a boy with answers to a past she can’t remember, leading to shocking revelations and emotional healing.','https://ia600404.us.archive.org/view_archive.php?archive=/33/items/l_covers_0010/l_covers_0010_54.zip&file=0010549926-L.jpg','9781471133435',406,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Hopeless+Colleen+Hoover',NULL),(96,'A Shot At History: My Obsessive Journey to Olympic Gold',25,7,NULL,2013,'English','A Shot at History chronicles Abhinav Bindra’s journey to becoming India’s first individual Olympic gold medalist. After a heartbreaking loss at the 2004 Athens Olympics, Bindra reinvented himself through relentless discipline, science, and mental training to achieve gold at the 2008 Beijing Olympics. The book is a powerful story of perseverance, innovation, and the pursuit of excellence, capturing the challenges of winning, losing, and striving to be better again.','https://www.jainbookagency.com/bookimages/zip/141715.jpg','9789350291122',250,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=A+Shot+At+History+Abhinav+Bindra',NULL),(97,'Thinking, Fast and Slow',57,7,NULL,2011,'English','Thinking, Fast and Slow explores how the mind works through two systems: System 1, which is fast and intuitive, and System 2, which is slow and logical. Daniel Kahneman reveals how cognitive biases like overconfidence and loss aversion shape our decisions in work and daily life. The book shows when to trust intuition, when to think more carefully, and how understanding both systems can improve judgment and decision-making.','https://imgv2-2-f.scribdassets.com/img/word_document/182569769/original/216x287/fb2c0855e3/1764652337?v=1','9780374275631',499,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Thinking+Fast+and+Slow+Daniel+Kahneman',NULL),(98,'Man and His Symbols',58,7,NULL,1968,'English','Man and His Symbols owes its existence to one of Jung\'s own dreams. The great psychologist dreamed that his work was understood by a wide public, rather than just by psychiatrists, and therefore he agreed to write and edit this fascinating book. Here, Jung examines the full world of the unconscious, whose language he believed to be the symbols constantly revealed in dreams. Convinced that dreams offer practical advice, sent from the unconscious to the conscious self, Jung felt that self-understanding would lead to a full and productive life. Thus, the reader will gain new insights into himself from this thoughtful volume, which also illustrates symbols throughout history. Completed just before his death by Jung and his associates, it is clearly addressed to the general reader.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MmBj3XHML.jpg','9780440351832',432,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Man+and+His+Symbols+Carl+Jung',NULL),(99,'How to Win Friends and Influence People',59,7,NULL,1998,'English','How to Win Friends and Influence People is a timeless classic that shows how to succeed by improving relationships and communication. First published in 1936, it has sold over 30 million copies and helped countless people achieve success in business and life. The book teaches practical principles for making people like you, winning others to your way of thinking, and influencing change without conflict.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/15130876-L.jpg','9788183227896',291,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=How+to+Win+Friends+and+Influence+People+Dale+Carnegie',NULL),(100,'Atomic Habits: An Easy & Proven Way to Build Good Habits & Break Bad Ones',60,7,NULL,2018,'English','No matter your goals, Atomic Habits offers a proven framework for improving—every day. James Clear, one of the world\'s leading experts on habit formation, reveals practical strategies that will teach you exactly how to form good habits, break bad ones, and master the tiny behaviors that lead to remarkable results.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re having trouble changing your habits, the problem isn\'t you. The problem is your system. Bad habits repeat themselves again and again not because you don\'t want to change, but because you have the wrong system for change. You do not rise to the level of your goals. You fall to the level of your systems. Here, you\'ll get a proven system that can take you to new heights.\r\n\r\nClear is known for his ability to distill complex topics into simple behaviors that can be easily applied to daily life and work. Here, he draws on the most proven ideas from biology, psychology, and neuroscience to create an easy-to-understand guide for making good habits inevitable and bad habits impossible. Along the way, readers will be inspired and entertained with true stories from Olympic gold medalists, award-winning artists, business leaders, life-saving physicians, and star comedians who have used the science of small habits to master their craft and vault to the top of their field.\r\n\r\nLearn how to:\r\n- Make time for new habits (even when life gets crazy);\r\n- Overcome a lack of motivation and willpower;\r\n- Design your environment to make success easier;\r\n- Get back on track when you fall off course;\r\n...and much more.\r\n\r\nAtomic Habits will reshape the way you think about progress and success, and give you the tools and strategies you need to transform your habits--whether you are a team looking to win a championship, an organization hoping to redefine an industry, or simply an individual who wishes to quit smoking, lose weight, reduce stress, or achieve any other goal.','https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcT-8SrFOsOtv4aBArFUoZyh50Tq-n7F0dIW-w&s','9780735211308',320,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Atomic+Habits+James+Clear',NULL),(101,'The Monk Who Sold His Ferrari: A Fable About Fulfilling Your Dreams and Reaching Your Destiny',63,7,NULL,1996,'English','This inspiring tale provides a step-by-step approach to living with greater courage, balance, abundance, and joy. A wonderfully crafted fable, The Monk Who Sold His Ferrari tells the extraordinary story of Julian Mantle, a lawyer forced to confront the spiritual crisis of his out-of-balance life. On a life-changing odyssey to an ancient culture, he discovers powerful, wise, and practical lessons that teach us to: \r\n\r\nDevelop Joyful Thoughts, Follow Our Life\'s Mission and Calling, Cultivate Self-Discipline and Act Courageously, Value Time as Our Most Important Commodity, Nourish Our Relationships, and Live Fully, One Day at a Time.\r\n','https://ia800507.us.archive.org/view_archive.php?archive=/8/items/l_covers_0009/l_covers_0009_78.zip&file=0009785304-L.jpg','9780062515674 ',198,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=The+Monk+Who+Sold+His+Ferrari+Robin+Sharma',NULL),(102,'aaaa',4,NULL,NULL,2019,'English','ti is a lfgjofgfdkg;gggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggggddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddddd',NULL,'123456789',NULL,NULL,NULL),(103,'just trying',4,NULL,NULL,2025,'Gujarati','qqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqqq',NULL,'123456789',NULL,NULL,NULL),(104,'Harry Potter and the Order of the Phoenix',2,1,5,2003,'English','Harry faces the rebellion of the Ministry and the rise of the Phoenix.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780439358064-M.jpg','9780439358064',766,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Harry+Potter+and+the+Order+of+the+Phoenix',NULL),(105,'Harry Potter and the Half-Blood Prince',2,1,6,2005,'English','Voldemort tightens his grip as Harry discovers an old textbook.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780439784542-M.jpg','9780439784542',607,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Harry+Potter+and+the+Half-Blood+Prince',NULL),(106,'Harry Potter and the Deathly Hallows',2,1,7,2007,'English','The final confrontation between Harry and Lord Voldemort.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1627042661i/58613224.jpg','9780545010221',607,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Harry+Potter+and+the+Deathly+Hallows',NULL),(107,'The Secret of the Nagas',15,4,2,2011,'English','Shiva searches for the sinister Naga warrior who killed his friend.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9789380658797-M.jpg','9789380658797',396,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=The+Secret+of+the+Nagas+Amish+Tripathi',NULL),(108,'The Oath of the Vayuputras',15,4,3,2013,'English','The final battle to save India from the evil of Somras.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9789382618348-M.jpg','9789382618348',575,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=The+Oath+of+the+Vayuputras+Amish+Tripathi',NULL),(109,'A Feast for Crows',27,2,4,2005,'English','The war-torn Seven Kingdoms face a shaky peace and new threats.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780553801507-M.jpg','9780553801507',753,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=A+Feast+for+Crows+George+Martin',NULL),(110,'A Dance with Dragons',27,2,5,2011,'English','Tyrion and Daenerys face new challenges in the East.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780553801477-M.jpg','9780553801477',1016,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=A+Dance+with+Dragons+George+Martin',NULL),(111,'Grandma\'s Bag of Stories',49,7,1,2012,'English','A collection of delightful short stories told by a grandmother.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780143332022-M.jpg','9780143332022',214,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Grandma%27s+Bag+of+Stories+Sudha+Murty',NULL),(112,'The Mother I Never Knew',49,7,1,2014,'English','Two novellas exploring the search for identity and mothers.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780143422255-M.jpg','9780143422255',212,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=The+Mother+I+Never+Knew+Sudha+Murty',NULL),(113,'One Indian Girl',39,7,1,2016,'English','A story about a successful woman dealing with love and family.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9788129142146-M.jpg','9788129142146',280,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=One+Indian+Girl+Chetan+Bhagat',NULL),(114,'The Girl in Room 105',39,7,1,2018,'English','An un-love story involving a mystery in a hostel room.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9781542040464-M.jpg','9781542040464',312,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=The+Girl+in+Room+105+Chetan+Bhagat',NULL),(115,'If We Ever Meet Again',28,17,1,2020,'English','One year, two opposites, and a love that will blindside them. Farrah Lin is a student at an elite university in Shanghai when she meets Blake Ryan, a confident and charming exchange student. Their attraction is immediate and intense, but as they navigate the pressures of their studies and the fleeting nature of their time together, they realize that sometimes love isn\'t enough to overcome the distance and secrets between them.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1674445315i/83818248.jpg','9781735056609',372,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=If+We+Ever+Meet+Again+Ana+Huang','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/6sHUmk2iU3IRrvxwobRMqY'),(116,'If the Sun Never Sets',28,17,2,2020,'English','Five years after their heartbreaking split, Farrah and Blake are reunited in a way they never expected. He is now a powerful CEO, and she is a successful interior designer. The resentment between them is as strong as the lingering chemistry, forcing them to confront the mistakes of their past. As they work together on a high-stakes project, they must decide if second chances are possible or if the sun has truly set on their relationship.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1674445537i/83818310.jpg','9781735056616',404,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=If+the+Sun+Never+Sets+Ana+Huang','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/1SY8lC4NsGUAcbcYnYNQio'),(117,'King of Wrath',28,15,1,2022,'English','Dante Russo is a ruthless billionaire who thrives on control and vengeance. When he is forced into an arranged marriage with Vivian Lau, the daughter of his enemy, he expects nothing but cold indifference. However, Vivian is not the submissive pawn he anticipated. Her fire and resilience begin to crack his icy exterior, leading to a dangerous game of obsession and desire where the lines between hate and love become blurred.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1742667348i/217206738.jpg','9781728290898',400,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=King+of+Wrath+Ana+Huang','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/32CmeK6XtLO7UUvvHraUMc'),(118,'King of Pride',28,15,2,2023,'English','Kai Young is the epitome of class, intellect, and restraint—a man who follows every rule to maintain his perfect reputation. Isabella Valencia is his polar opposite: a chaotic, fiery bartender who challenges everything he stands for. When they are forced to spend time together, their clashing personalities ignite a forbidden spark. Kai must choose between the legacy he was born into and the woman who makes him feel truly alive.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1680192054i/62994279.jpg','9781728290911',448,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=King+of+Pride+Ana+Huang','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/6kMJRR9A6tGbiNiRy9EgTz'),(119,'King of Greed',28,15,3,2023,'English','Set against the backdrop of the ruthless fashion industry, this rivals-to-lovers story features two titans competing for the top spot. It explores the darker side of ambition where the line between wanting what someone has and wanting them becomes dangerously blurred. It’s a story of obsession, secret alliances, and the realization that envy is a hollow victory compared to the person you are fighting against.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1687764099i/124943221.jpg','9781728290935',352,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=King+of+Greed+Ana+Huang','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/7cq2Cpf0q9HwmtVjNb6wN9'),(120,'King of Sloth',28,15,4,2024,'English','Xavier Castillo is the ultimate \"charming playboy\" heir—he has never had to work for anything, and he prefers it that way. Enter Sloane Kensington, a fierce, high-stakes PR agent who has been hired to clean up his messy image. She is everything he is not: driven, disciplined, and utterly unimpressed by his wealth. As they clash in the boardroom and beyond, the tension shifts from professional to personal, forcing Xavier to decide if he’s finally willing to put in the effort for the one woman he can’t charm his way into keeping.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1701973993i/75491526.jpg','9781728290959',380,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=King+of+Sloth+Ana+Huang','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/3Mkpoge9gBXAjl3eH7Gx46'),(121,'King of Envy',28,15,5,2025,'English','Set against the backdrop of the ruthless fashion industry, this rivals-to-lovers story features two titans competing for the top spot. It explores the darker side of ambition where the line between wanting what someone has and wanting them becomes dangerously blurred. It’s a story of obsession, secret alliances, and the realization that envy is a hollow victory compared to the person you are fighting against','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1731603584i/210825471.jpg','9781728290973',400,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=King+of+Envy+Ana+Huang','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/3G823VzwD6ahqVGuJ6OpPC'),(122,'If Love Had a Price',28,17,3,2020,'English','A steamy romance about risks and secrets where a gambler meets a girl who plays it safe.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1674445708i/83818333.jpg','9781735056623',380,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=If+Love+Had+a+Price+Ana+Huang','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/1nyeQ1XzGMBFAtZi9W0Qz5'),(123,'If We Were Perfect',28,17,4,2020,'English','They were the perfect couple until a secret tore them apart. Years later, these childhood best friends find their way back to each other. This heartfelt second-chance romance focuses on forgiveness, healing old wounds, and finally choosing the person you were always meant to be with.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1674445785i/83818340.jpg','9781735056630',360,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=If+We+Were+Perfect+Ana+Huang','https://open.spotify.com/playlist/2Bstz3IBjK2s0MlZkM1HVU'),(124,'Clean Code: A Handbook of Agile Software Craftsmanship',73,7,NULL,2008,'English','A comprehensive guide to writing cleaner, more maintainable code through principles, patterns, and practices.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0132350882.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780132350884',464,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Clean+Code+Robert+Martin',NULL),(125,'The Pragmatic Programmer: Your Journey To Mastery',74,7,NULL,1999,'English','A classic that cuts through the increasing specialization and technicalities of modern software development to examine the core process.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/020161622X.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780201616224',352,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=The+Pragmatic+Programmer',NULL),(126,'Introduction to Algorithms',75,7,NULL,1989,'English','A fundamental textbook on algorithms used worldwide, covering a broad range of algorithms in depth.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0262033844.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780262033848',1312,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Introduction+to+Algorithms+Cormen',NULL),(127,'Design Patterns: Elements of Reusable Object-Oriented Software',76,7,NULL,1994,'English','A seminal work in software engineering, introducing 23 classic software design patterns that solve common design problems.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0201633612.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780201633610',395,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Design+Patterns+Erich+Gamma',NULL),(128,'The Mythical Man-Month: Essays on Software Engineering',77,7,NULL,1975,'English','A classic collection of essays on software engineering and project management, famous for introducing Brooks’s Law.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0201835959.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780201835953',322,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=The+Mythical+Man-Month',NULL),(129,'Hands-On Machine Learning with Scikit-Learn, Keras, and TensorFlow',78,7,NULL,2019,'English','A practical guide to building intelligent systems, covering regression, neural networks, deep learning, and model optimization.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/1492032646.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9781492032649',856,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Hands-On+Machine+Learning+Aurelien+Geron',NULL),(130,'Python for Data Analysis',79,7,NULL,2012,'English','The ultimate guide to manipulating, processing, cleaning, and crunching datasets in Python using pandas, NumPy, and Jupyter.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/1491957662.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9781491957660',541,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Python+for+Data+Analysis+Wes+McKinney',NULL),(131,'Better Than the Movies',81,7,NULL,2021,'English','Liz Buxbaum attempts to win over her childhood crush Michael with the help of her annoying neighbor, Wes.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/1534467629.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9781534467620',368,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/1534467629',NULL),(132,'The Do-Over',81,7,NULL,2022,'English','Emilie Hornby finds herself stuck in a Groundhog Day-style loop of the most disastrous Valentine’s Day of her life.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/1534478876.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9781534478879',320,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/1534478876',NULL),(133,'Mr. Wrong Number',81,7,NULL,2022,'English','A misdialed text leads to a steamy secret relationship between a bad-luck-prone woman and her brother’s best friend.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/059343725X.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780593437254',352,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/059343725X',NULL),(134,'The Love Wager',81,7,NULL,2023,'English','A bet between two people on a quest to find their \"real\" soulmates leads to a road trip and unexpected feelings.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0593437284.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780593437285',320,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593437284',NULL),(135,'Betting on You',81,7,NULL,2023,'English','Charlie and Bailey meet on a flight and enter a bet about whether a couple at the airport will stay together.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/1534478906.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9781534478909',352,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/1534478906',NULL),(136,'Nothing Like the Movies',81,7,NULL,2024,'English','The highly anticipated sequel to Better Than the Movies, following Wes and Liz as they navigate college life.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/1665921862.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9781665921862',384,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/1665921862',NULL),(137,'Accidentally Amy',81,7,NULL,2022,'English','Isabella takes the wrong Starbucks order and meets a man who thinks she is the woman on the cup—a woman named Amy.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0593817087.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780593817087',352,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/0593817087',NULL),(138,'The Unhoneymooners',82,7,NULL,2019,'English','For two sworn enemies, anything can happen during a Hawaiian trip of a lifetime—even love.','https://books.google.com/books/content?vid=ISBN9781501128035&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1','9781501128035',400,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/1501128030',NULL),(139,'Love and Other Words',82,7,NULL,2018,'English','A story of childhood sweethearts Macy and Elliot, told in alternating timelines between \"then\" and \"now.\"','https://books.google.com/books/content?vid=ISBN9781501128011&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1','9781501128011',432,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/1501128014',NULL),(140,'The Soulmate Equation',82,7,NULL,2021,'English','A single mom turns to a DNA-based matchmaking service and finds a high-compatibility match with the arrogant founder.','https://books.google.com/books/content?vid=ISBN9781982123963&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1','9781982123963',368,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/1982123961',NULL),(141,'Josh and Hazel\'s Guide to Not Dating',82,7,NULL,2018,'English','Two best friends set each other up on a series of disastrous double dates while trying to ignore their own spark.','https://books.google.com/books/content?vid=ISBN9781501128028&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1','9781501128028',352,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/1501128022',NULL),(142,'The True Love Experiment',82,7,NULL,2023,'English','A romance novelist and a documentary filmmaker join forces for a reality show that puts love under the microscope.','https://books.google.com/books/content?vid=ISBN9781982173432&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1','9781982173432',416,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/1982173438',NULL),(143,'Beautiful Bastard',82,7,NULL,2013,'English','An ambitious intern and her difficult-to-please boss find themselves locked in a high-stakes office rivalry.','https://books.google.com/books/content?vid=ISBN9781476730004&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1','9781476730004',320,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/1476730003',NULL),(144,'Something Wilder',82,7,NULL,2022,'English','Lily Wilder guides tourists through red rock canyons when her ex-boyfriend shows up on a trip that turns into a treasure hunt.','https://books.google.com/books/content?vid=ISBN9781982173401&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1','9781982173401',368,'https://www.amazon.com/dp/1982173403',NULL),(145,'Luv Shuv in New York',83,7,NULL,2024,'English','An opposites-attract, interracial romance set in the busy streets of New York City.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1671884000i/75265091.jpg','9798218151522',360,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Luv+Shuv+in+New+York+NM+Patel',NULL),(146,'Luv Under Starlight',83,7,NULL,2023,'English','A steamy roommates-to-lovers romance that explores love and vulnerability under the stars.','https://m.media-amazon.com/images/S/compressed.photo.goodreads.com/books/1698959740i/201381739.jpg','9798218204624',380,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Luv+Under+Starlight+NM+Patel',NULL),(147,'Luv (Un)Arranged',83,7,NULL,2025,'English','A steamy Desi arranged marriage romance that challenges traditional expectations.','https://books.google.com/books/content?vid=ISBN9798988083023&printsec=frontcover&img=1&zoom=1','9798988083023',390,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Luv+UnArranged+NM+Patel',NULL),(148,'You Don\'t Know JS: Scope & Closures',84,7,NULL,2014,'English','A deep dive into how scope and closures work under the hood in JavaScript.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/1449335586.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9781449335588',98,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=You+Dont+Know+JS+Kyle+Simpson',NULL),(149,'Cracking the Coding Interview',85,7,NULL,2015,'English','189 programming interview questions and solutions, a standard reference for technical interview prep.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0984782850.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780984782857',687,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Cracking+the+Coding+Interview',NULL),(150,'Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs',86,7,NULL,1985,'English','A foundational MIT textbook teaching core programming ideas through Scheme.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0262510871.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780262510875',657,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Structure+and+Interpretation+of+Computer+Programs',NULL),(151,'Computer Networking: A Top-Down Approach',87,7,NULL,2016,'English','A widely used textbook introducing computer networking from the application layer down.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0133594149.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780133594140',864,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Computer+Networking+Top+Down+Approach',NULL),(152,'Operating System Concepts',88,7,NULL,2018,'English','A classic textbook covering process management, memory, storage, and OS design principles.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/1119320917.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9781119320913',976,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Operating+System+Concepts+Silberschatz',NULL),(153,'Database System Concepts',88,7,NULL,2019,'English','A comprehensive textbook on relational databases, SQL, transactions, and database design.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0078022159.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780078022159',1376,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Database+System+Concepts+Silberschatz',NULL),(154,'Deep Learning',89,7,NULL,2016,'English','A comprehensive introduction to deep learning, covering theory and mathematical foundations.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0262035618.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780262035613',800,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Deep+Learning+Ian+Goodfellow',NULL),(155,'Artificial Intelligence: A Modern Approach',90,7,NULL,2020,'English','The leading textbook in AI, covering search, logic, planning, learning, and more.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0134610997.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780134610993',1136,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Artificial+Intelligence+A+Modern+Approach',NULL),(156,'The C Programming Language',91,7,NULL,1988,'English','The definitive reference on the C language, written by its co-creators.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0131103628.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780131103627',272,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=The+C+Programming+Language+Kernighan',NULL),(157,'Effective Java',92,7,NULL,2017,'English','Best practices for the Java platform, covering idioms experienced programmers use.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0134685997.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780134685991',412,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Effective+Java+Joshua+Bloch',NULL),(158,'Refactoring: Improving the Design of Existing Code',93,7,NULL,2018,'English','A catalog of refactoring techniques for improving code structure without changing behavior.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/0134757599.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9780134757599',448,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Refactoring+Martin+Fowler',NULL),(159,'Grokking Algorithms',94,7,NULL,2016,'English','An illustrated, friendly guide to common algorithms for programmers.','https://images-na.ssl-images-amazon.com/images/P/1617292230.01._SCLZZZZZZZ_.jpg','9781617292231',256,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Grokking+Algorithms+Aditya+Bhargava',NULL),(160,'The Art of Computer Programming, Volume 1: Fundamental Algorithms',95,7,NULL,1968,'English','Widely regarded as one of the most important works ever written on computer science, this landmark volume lays the mathematical and algorithmic groundwork for everything that follows in the series. Knuth begins with basic programming concepts and information structures before moving into a rigorous treatment of data structures such as linked lists, trees, and stacks, using his own hypothetical assembly language, MIX, to make every algorithm\'s behavior concrete and analyzable. Rather than simply presenting solutions, the book teaches readers to reason precisely about correctness, efficiency, and the trade-offs between different approaches -- a discipline Knuth calls \"the analysis of algorithms.\" Dense with mathematics but written with a teacher\'s clarity, it rewards slow, careful reading and has shaped how generations of computer scientists think about programs as objects worthy of formal study. It remains a reference many professionals return to throughout their careers rather than a book read once and shelved.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780201896831-M.jpg','9780201896831',672,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=The+Art+of+Computer+Programming+Volume+1+Fundamental+Algorithms',NULL),(161,'Working Effectively with Legacy Code',96,7,NULL,2004,'English','Michael Feathers tackles a problem every working programmer eventually faces: how do you safely change code you did not write, do not fully understand, and that has no tests? Feathers defines legacy code simply as \"code without tests,\" and builds a practical toolkit of techniques -- dependency-breaking strategies, seams, characterization tests, and small, verifiable refactoring steps -- for bringing such code under control before modifying it. The book is organized around common, painfully specific scenarios (\"I can\'t get this class into a test harness,\" \"I need to make a change but I don\'t know what tests to write\"), each paired with concrete, language-agnostic techniques for making progress without rewriting everything from scratch. It\'s less about elegant software design in the abstract and more about the messy reality of maintaining large systems under deadline pressure, which is exactly why it has remained a staple recommendation for engineers inheriting unfamiliar codebases nearly two decades after publication.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780131177055-M.jpg','9780131177055',464,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Working+Effectively+with+Legacy+Code',NULL),(162,'Computer Systems: A Programmer\'s Perspective',97,7,NULL,2002,'English','This textbook takes a \"programmer\'s-eye view\" of how computer systems actually execute the code developers write, deliberately bridging the gap between application-level programming and the underlying hardware and operating system. Bryant and his co-author walk through how C programs are represented in memory, how compilers translate high-level code into machine instructions, how the memory hierarchy (registers, caches, RAM, disk) affects real-world performance, and how processes, virtual memory, and networking work beneath the abstractions most programmers take for granted. Each concept is tied back to concrete performance implications -- why one loop ordering is dramatically faster than another, why a program crashes with a segmentation fault, how a network request actually travels through the system -- so readers come away not just knowing facts about computer architecture but able to reason about and optimize the behavior of their own programs. It\'s frequently used in university systems courses precisely because it treats systems knowledge as something that makes you a measurably better programmer, not an abstract academic subject.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780134092669-M.jpg','9780134092669',1108,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Computer+Systems+A+Programmer\'s+Perspective',NULL),(163,'Eloquent JavaScript: A Modern Introduction to Programming',98,7,NULL,2011,'English','Part programming tutorial, part broader introduction to computational thinking, this book teaches JavaScript from first principles while also using it as a vehicle for explaining general programming concepts like functions, data structures, recursion, and abstraction. Haverbeke writes in a notably conversational, sometimes philosophical style, weaving in reflections on why programming works the way it does alongside hands-on exercises. Later chapters move beyond language basics into practical territory: manipulating the browser DOM, handling asynchronous programming with promises and async/await, working with Node.js, and even building small projects like a pixel art editor and a platform game entirely in the book\'s interactive sandboxed code examples. Because the entire book is also available free online with runnable code snippets embedded directly in the text, it has become a popular self-teaching resource for programmers coming to JavaScript from other languages as well as complete beginners, and it\'s frequently recommended as a more rigorous alternative to shorter \"learn X in a weekend\" guides.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9781593279509-M.jpg','9781593279509',472,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Eloquent+JavaScript+A+Modern+Introduction+to+Programming',NULL),(164,'Designing Data-Intensive Applications',99,7,NULL,2017,'English','Kleppmann\'s book is widely considered one of the essential references for engineers building systems that need to reliably store, retrieve, and process large amounts of data. Rather than promoting any single technology, it builds a conceptual framework for reasoning about data systems in general: how databases represent and index data internally, the trade-offs between different replication and partitioning strategies, what consistency guarantees actually mean in distributed systems, and how batch and stream processing pipelines fit together in modern architectures. The book is unusually good at demystifying jargon that gets thrown around casually in engineering discussions -- terms like \"eventual consistency,\" \"linearizability,\" and \"exactly-once semantics\" are each given careful, precise treatment along with the real-world failure modes that make them matter. It draws on decades of distributed systems research as well as the practical experience of building systems at scale, and it\'s frequently cited by engineers as the book that finally made concepts like the CAP theorem, consensus algorithms, and CRDTs click for them in a way that shorter blog posts never quite managed.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9781449373320-M.jpg','9781449373320',616,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Designing+Data-Intensive+Applications',NULL),(165,'Code: The Hidden Language of Computer Hardware and Software',100,7,NULL,1999,'English','Petzold takes an unusual and highly effective approach to explaining how computers work: rather than starting with modern chips and abstractions, he begins with simple, tangible ideas -- Morse code, Braille, flashlight signaling -- and builds up, step by logical step, to relays, logic gates, binary arithmetic, and eventually a complete working model of a computer processor. The book is aimed squarely at curious readers with no technical background, but it doesn\'t shy away from real technical depth; by the final chapters, readers understand not just that a CPU can add two numbers, but genuinely why and how, having built the concept up from switches and wires. Because it constructs computing from first principles rather than presenting finished abstractions to be memorized, it has become a favorite recommendation for people who feel they \"just don\'t get\" how computers actually function underneath the software they use every day, offering the kind of aha-moment understanding that\'s hard to get from a typical intro programming course.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780735611313-M.jpg','9780735611313',400,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Code+The+Hidden+Language+of+Computer+Hardware+and+Software',NULL),(166,'The Phoenix Project: A Novel About IT, DevOps, and Helping Your Business Win',101,7,NULL,2013,'English','Structured as a business novel rather than a technical manual, The Phoenix Project follows Bill Palmer, an IT manager suddenly promoted to VP of IT Operations at a struggling auto parts company, as he tries to rescue a critically overdue and over-budget project while keeping the company\'s existing systems from collapsing under constant firefighting. Through Bill\'s crisis-driven education under a mentor named Erik, the book dramatizes core DevOps principles -- treating IT operations like a manufacturing flow, limiting work in progress, making bottlenecks visible, and breaking down the wall between development and operations teams -- by embedding them in a plot readers actually want to follow rather than presenting them as abstract best practices. It\'s frequently handed to engineering managers and executives specifically because the narrative format makes ideas like \"the three ways\" of DevOps and the dangers of unmanaged technical debt land emotionally in a way that a straightforward business or technical book often doesn\'t, which is part of why it helped popularize DevOps thinking well beyond specialist circles.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780988262591-M.jpg','9780988262591',432,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=The+Phoenix+Project+A+Novel+About+IT+DevOps+and+Helping+Your+Business+Win',NULL),(167,'Programming Pearls',102,7,NULL,1986,'English','Originally a long-running column in Communications of the ACM, Programming Pearls collects short, self-contained essays -- each built around a specific problem -- that model how experienced programmers actually think through algorithm design and code efficiency in practice. Bentley walks through puzzles like sorting enormous datasets that don\'t fit in memory, verifying a program\'s correctness through back-of-the-envelope estimation, and squeezing surprising amounts of performance out of simple code through careful attention to data structures and problem reformulation, rather than brute-force optimization. What sets the book apart is its emphasis on the thought process rather than just the final solution: each \"pearl\" walks through false starts, partial solutions, and the reasoning that eventually leads to an elegant answer, treating programming as a craft of problem-solving as much as a technical skill. Despite its age and the shift in specific technologies discussed, it remains a frequently recommended read for engineers wanting to sharpen how they approach algorithmic problems rather than just memorize solutions to known ones.','https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/isbn/9780201657883-M.jpg','9780201657883',239,'https://www.amazon.com/s?k=Programming+Pearls',NULL);
/*!40000 ALTER TABLE `books` ENABLE KEYS */;
UNLOCK TABLES;

