ed feelings about this one. The idea is interesting but the execution felt uneven. Worth a try if you like the genre.','2026-08-27 15:25:53'),(829,63,130,3,'Fairly average. The content is valuable but parts feel outdated or overly theoretical. Helpful for exams, not much more.','2026-06-19 15:52:23'),(830,64,151,2,'Good content, mixed delivery. Some sections are very helpful but others are dense and hard to follow without prior knowledge. Better as a reference than a read.','2026-07-07 12:48:32'),(831,64,85,5,'I devoured this in one sitting. I laughed, I cried, and I felt every emotion along the way. Perfect comfort read, five stars.','2026-07-10 11:31:15'),(832,64,167,3,'Decent book. Good as a reference, though not enjoyable to read cover to cover. Okay for the price.','2026-06-22 14:39:49'),(833,65,48,3,'Mixed feelings about this one. Good writing but the plot was predictable in places. Worth a try if you like the genre.','2026-07-16 01:26:28'),(834,65,152,2,'Very disappointing. I gave up halfway because nothing seemed to connect. Not worth the money.','2026-08-05 12:32:09'),(835,65,20,4,'Highly informative and engaging. The author makes complex topics accessible and genuinely interesting. Worth every minute.','2026-07-28 08:27:17'),(836,66,29,2,'Such a letdown. The pacing was painfully slow and I just didn\'t care about either lead. Not recommended.','2026-05-29 00:02:35'),(837,66,132,4,'Such a gorgeous love story. The romance feels authentic and the writing is warm and heartfelt. Highly recommend to anyone who loves romance.','2026-07-20 19:08:39'),(838,66,76,5,'Brilliant from start to finish. Great character development and a plot full of clever twists. I\'ll be rereading this for sure.','2026-07-04 09:35:18'),(839,67,111,2,'Mixed feelings about this one. Some parts were engaging but the middle dragged quite a bit. Might work better for other readers.','2026-08-12 19:18:11'),(840,67,145,5,'My heart is still not okay. I laughed, I cried, and I felt every emotion along the way. Can\'t wait to read more from this author.','2026-08-12 23:13:05'),(841,67,153,5,'Fantastic resource. Well organised and packed with real-world advice I could apply at work immediately. Five stars.','2026-07-21 18:56:58'),(842,68,8,2,'Not bad, not great. The characters were fine, though I never fully connected with them. Not a favourite, but not a waste of time either.','2026-09-14 08:03:00'),(843,68,14,1,'Sadly, this was not for me. The ending was rushed and made the whole thing feel pointless. Skip this one.','2026-08-13 07:27:43'),(844,68,73,2,'It was okay. Some parts were engaging but the middle dragged quite a bit. Not a favourite, but not a waste of time either.','2026-07-28 09:15:23'),(845,69,113,4,'My heart is still not okay. I laughed, I cried, and I felt every emotion along the way. I need more books like this.','2026-07-16 08:08:39'),(846,69,154,5,'Fantastic resource. The explanations are clear, the examples are practical and it made difficult concepts finally click. Worth every rupee.','2026-07-11 03:42:04'),(847,69,157,4,'Useful but demanding. Good as a reference, though not enjoyable to read cover to cover. Okay for the price.','2026-09-08 10:15:26'),(848,70,48,2,'I struggled to finish this. Too many plot holes and a story that never found its footing. One star, and that\'s being generous.','2026-07-03 17:52:40'),(849,70,145,3,'Had its moments. Nice story but the characters made some frustrating decisions. Decent light read.','2026-08-09 01:49:50'),(850,70,82,5,'I devoured this in one sitting. The chemistry between the leads is incredible and the emotional moments hit hard. Instant favourite.','2026-07-01 16:26:00'),(851,71,58,2,'Boring and forgettable. The writing felt clumsy and the dialogue was unconvincing. I expected so much more.','2026-09-07 09:52:12'),(852,71,52,3,'A decent read overall. The idea is interesting but the execution felt uneven. Not a favourite, but not a waste of time either.','2026-09-13 21:34:00'),(853,71,138,2,'I really wanted to love this. The pacing was painfully slow and I just didn\'t care about either lead. Couldn\'t wait to be done.','2026-08-28 06:57:00');
